		{"id":"19ef5bb193d2a689","type":"text","text":"# Activity URL\n# ASYNCH MATCH\n\nDesigned to bypass geographical and timezone limitations. \n\nBoth sides must upload a PDF of written case or at least audio recording of the speaker. Video files are considered the gold standard with an emoji mask for privacy. \n\nAudio will be used to verify the written case and vice versa. Submissions without audio recording will be computer generated. For such cases, a higher degree of security is warranted and thus will be subject to additional inconveniences for purposes pertaining to identity authentication. \n\n\nRules: \nTo be viewed and responded within 24 hours \nMust submit all citations mentioned on speech \nThe two opposing cases will be obtained in text form via transcription or submission\n\nRules: \nSince CON won the coin toss, PRO will first respond to the CON questions from the Front-End Speech. \nEach response must be within 2 min and any words after will not be considered for adjudication. \n\n\n\n\n\n","x":-3685,"y":4220,"width":480,"height":738,"color":"#ffffff"},
