		{"id":"1a90fd62005712b5","type":"text","text":"Equanimity / Empathy / Fairness / Acceptance / Diligence / Self-evident\n@ callSign FE mm:ss \"That was great!\" (tag: thinking)\n@ callSign BE mm:ss \"That was a really smooth way to say ... Spot on!\" (tag: speaking)\n\nStrategy / Issues / Warrant / Organization\n\n@ callSign 1CF mm:ss \"Let's go!\" (tag: writing)\n@ callSign 2CF mm:ss \"Where did that come from?\" (tag: )\n@ callSign SUM mm:ss \"Need more evidence to support that claim.\" (tag: )\n\nNon-verbal / Verbal / Clarity / Confidence\n\n@ callSign FE mm:ss \"Please speak louder\" (tag: )\n@ callSign SUM mm:ss \"Say it with a bit more conviction!\" (tag: )","x":1397,"y":7149,"width":447,"height":452,"color":"#ffffff"},
